#. あ、苗木！　おっはー！！
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Mornin', Makoto!"
msgstr ""

#. おはよう…
#. もう、みんな揃ってるの？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Good morning... Is everyone here already?"
msgstr ""

#. いんや、十神っちと石丸っちがまだだべ。
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Nope! Still waitin' on Byakuya and Taka."
msgstr ""

#. 十神クンはともかく…
#. 石丸クンがまだ来てないなんて珍しいね。
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Byakuya's no surprise, but it's strange Taka's not\n"
"here yet..."
msgstr ""

#. 石丸君でしたら、遅刻魔の十神君を呼びに、
#. 部屋まで迎えに行きましたわ。
msgctxt "0005 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Knowing Taka, I imagine he is trying to get the King\n"
"of Tardiness up and out of bed."
msgstr ""

#. すぐに戻ってくるはずだ。
#. 我らは、ここで待っているとしよう…
msgctxt "0006 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I'm sure they'll be here soon enough. Just be\n"
"patient..."
msgstr ""

#. 待つのは構いませんが、
#. １つ問題があるのです。
msgctxt "0007 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I don't mind waiting for them, but there is one\n"
"problem..."
msgstr ""

#. …問題？
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Which is...?"
msgstr ""

#. 喉が渇きました。
msgctxt "0009 | CELES"
msgid "I am thirsty."
msgstr ""

#. どこが問題だっつーの…
msgctxt "0010 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "How the hell is that a problem!?"
msgstr ""

#. 山田君、紅茶を入れてくださる？
msgctxt "0011 | CELES"
msgid "Hifumi, would you make me some tea?"
msgstr ""

#. …はい？
msgctxt "0012 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. ミルクティーをお願いしますわね。
msgctxt "0013 | CELES"
msgid "Milk tea, if you please."
msgstr ""

#. な、なぜ…僕が…？
msgctxt "0014 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Wh...why me?"
msgstr ""

#. あなたの丸い体系は、わたくしが通っていた喫茶店の
#. マスターにそっくりですわ。
msgctxt "0015 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Your roundish figure reminds me of the owner of the\n"
"coffee shop I used to frequent."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな理由…なんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's your reason...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 喉がカラカラですの。急ぎで願いますわ。
msgctxt "0017 | CELES"
msgid "I can feel my throat drying out. Quickly, please."
msgstr ""

#. わ、わかりましたよぉ…
msgctxt "0018 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "O-Okay..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>セレスさんの命令には逆らえなかったらしく、
#. 山田クンはしぶしぶ厨房へと入っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Apparently unable to refuse Celeste's order, Hifumi\n"
"skulked his way into the kitchen.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、数分後…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And a few minutes later...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. お待たせしました！！
msgctxt "0021 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Thank you for waiting!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あたりに紅茶の匂いを漂わせながら、
#. 山田クンはトレイを片手に戻って来た。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hifumi reappeared with tray in hand, the gentle aroma\n"
"growing stronger as he approached.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うふふ、待っていましたわよ。
msgctxt "0023 | CELES"
msgid "Hmhmhm. Finally..."
msgstr ""

#. つ、ついでに…
#. 全員分いれてくれれば…いいのに…
msgctxt "0024 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You c-could've made some for the r-rest of us, you\n"
"know..."
msgstr ""

#. お前は全然タイプじゃないから、
#. 断固拒否だ！
msgctxt "0025 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "I emphatically decline! You're not my type at all!"
msgstr ""

#. フフ…すべては因果律の流れのままに…
msgctxt "0026 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Hmhm... It's all about the law of causality, basic\n"
"instinct, act and react!"
msgstr ""

#. ぐ…ぐぐ……
msgctxt "0027 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Grr..."
msgstr ""

#. では、頂きますわね…
msgctxt "0028 | CELES"
msgid "Well then, if you don't mind..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>口元に笑みを浮かべながら、
#. ティーカップを手にしたセレスさんだったが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A small smile played across her lips as she held the\n"
"tea cup delicately in her hand...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …あら？
msgctxt "0030 | CELES"
msgid "...Wait."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>と小首をかしげると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She cocked her head to the side...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>突然、彼女は手にしていたカップを
#. 壁に向かって放り投げた！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | CELES"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...and threw the cup as hard as she could at the wall!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガシャーン！」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*CRASH*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. えー！？
msgctxt "0034 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "What the—!?"
msgstr ""

#. チョイチョイ…何をなさるかウサギさん？
msgctxt "0035 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "H-Hey! What are you doing, my little white rabbit!?"
msgstr ""

#. わたくし、こういうミルクティーって、
#. 嫌いなんですわ！
msgctxt "0036 | CELES"
msgid "I HATE this kind of tea!"
msgstr ""

#. え、えーと…理解しかねますが…
msgctxt "0037 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "U-Umm...I don't understand..."
msgstr ""

#. 例えば、その辺の普通の喫茶店で、
#. 紅茶を注文するとしましょう…
msgctxt "0038 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Imagine we are at a coffee shop—just any normal,\n"
"everyday cafe. I sit down, and I order some tea."
msgstr ""

#. すると、『レモンですか？　ミルクですか？』
#. と聞かれる場合がありますわよね？
msgctxt "0039 | CELES"
msgid "They then ask me, \"Would you like lemon, or milk?\""
msgstr ""

#. そこで、わたくしはミルクティーと答えます。
msgctxt "0040 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Now, further imagine that I replied, \"Ah, yes, I would\n"
"like milk tea, please.\""
msgstr ""

#. すると、紅茶と共に小さい容器に入れられたミルクが
#. 運ばれて来たりするのですが…
msgctxt "0041 | CELES"
msgid ""
"In this case, along with my tea they may bring me a\n"
"small container of milk, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. わたくしは、ミルクティーをいれる際、
#. ミルクを先に入れたい派なのです。
msgctxt "0042 | CELES"
msgid ""
"But this is not for me! I am among those who prefer\n"
"the milk to be part of the process from the outset!"
msgstr ""

#. その方が、圧倒的に香りがよろしいのです。
msgctxt "0043 | CELES"
msgid ""
"The fragrance is just so overwhelmingly sweet that\n"
"way..."
msgstr ""

#. それに、飲む直前にレモンかミルクを入れるかなんて、
#. 調味料レベルの選択肢と変わらないじゃないですか。
msgctxt "0044 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Adding milk or lemon right before you drink is like\n"
"dousing your fries in ketchup—mere condiments!"
msgstr ""

#. そもそも、その程度をメニューの選択肢として
#. 認めていいのかも疑問ですわ。
msgctxt "0045 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Whenever looking for a cafe, I first review their menu\n"
"to see if it offers the proper style of milk tea."
msgstr ""

#. ですから、わたくしは牛乳で紅茶を煮出す、
#. “ロイヤルミルクティー”しか認めていませんの。
msgctxt "0046 | CELES"
msgid ""
"And I cannot acknowledge any \"milk tea\" that does not\n"
"add the milk during the brewing process!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その時の、ボクらの反応を表現するとしたら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I had to describe our shared reaction to what we'd\n"
"just heard...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>“目を白黒させて”って以外の表現は、
#. 見当たらなかったはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I'd have to go with \"wide-eyed bewilderment.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. えっと…せっかく紅茶を作ったってのに…
#. そこまでしろと！？
msgctxt "0049 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Umm...I went to all that trouble to make you that\n"
"tea...and you wanted me to go even farther?"
msgstr ""

#. 面倒なのは知っていますわ…
msgctxt "0050 | CELES"
msgid "Yes, I realize it can be a bit of a hassle.."
msgstr ""

#. ミルクティーとロイヤルミルクティーの両方が
#. 置いてある店では、後者の方が値段が高いですからね。
msgctxt "0051 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Even in cafes that offer proper milk tea, it is always\n"
"more expensive than simple tea with milk."
msgstr ""

#. きっと手間がかかるんでしょう。
#. ですが…
msgctxt "0052 | CELES"
msgid "It takes more time to prepare, surely, but..."
msgstr ""

#. 手間をかけないで、何がメニューでしょう。
msgctxt "0053 | CELES"
msgid ""
"...why even bother creating a menu if you are not\n"
"going to offer the highest level of quality!?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、そもそも…メニューも何も…
msgctxt "0054 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Well, um...we don't actually have a menu..."
msgstr ""

#. いいから早く持って来い、このブタがぁぁぁ！！！
msgctxt "0055 | CELES"
msgid ""
"That does not matter. Hurry up and bring me what I\n"
"asked for, swine!"
msgstr ""

#. えーーーーーッ！？
msgctxt "0056 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "WHAAAAAT!?"
msgstr ""

#. は、はいっ！
#. ブタめがすぐに持ってまいりますぅぅ！！
msgctxt "0057 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "O-Okay! Your little piggy will bring it right out!"
msgstr ""

#. うふ。恐喝は便利ですわね。
msgctxt "0058 | CELES"
msgid "Hmhm. I do so love coercion."
msgstr ""

#. 人格…変わったけど…
msgctxt "0059 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You were like...a totally different person just now."
msgstr ""

#. クソ…一瞬ブルッちまったぜ…
msgctxt "0060 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Yeah, shit... You really went psycho there."
msgstr ""

#. うふふふふふ…
msgctxt "0061 | CELES"
msgid "Hmhmhm..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>セレスさん…やっぱ最初の印象通り…
#. 一筋縄じゃいかない人みたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I knew there was more to her when I first met her...\n"
"I'd hate to have her as an enemy.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…と、ボクらがセレスさんの本性に、
#. 戦々恐々としていたところで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0063 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Seriously, man. She's one scary chick...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>食堂のドアが開け放たれ、
#. そして、ようやく待ち人はやって来た…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...the dining hall doors flew open, and one of the\n"
"late arrivals came storming in.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>のだが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おい、諸君！　妙な事態になったぞ…！
msgctxt "0066 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Bad news, everyone! There is a mystery afoot!"
msgstr ""

#. へ？　どうしたん？
msgctxt "0067 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh? What happened?"
msgstr ""

#. 十神くんが部屋から出て来ないんだ…
msgctxt "0068 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "It would seem Byakuya refuses to leave his room!"
msgstr ""

#. 何度インターホンを押しても、
#. まったく出て来ないんだ…
msgctxt "0069 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"I stood there pressing his doorbell over and over,\n"
"but he never showed himself."
msgstr ""

#. 居留守…じゃなくて…？
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Maybe he just...wasn't there."
msgstr ""

#. だったら…いいのだが…
#. ひょっとして、<CLT 3>彼の身に何かあった<CLT>のではないかと…
msgctxt "0071 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"I'd like to think so. But I'm worried <CLT 3>something might\n"
"have happened to him<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何か…その言葉が意味するもの…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What he meant by that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それ以上は言わなくても…
#. その場の誰もが理解しているようだった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He didn't have to say anything else. Everyone\n"
"understood exactly what that might mean...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. さ、捜してみた方がいいかもね…
#. みんなで手分けして…
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I-It might be a good idea if we all split up and go\n"
"look for him."
msgstr ""

#. 言っておくが、僕もそう提案しようと思ってたんだッ！
msgctxt "0075 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Ah! I was just about to suggest the same thing!"
msgstr ""

#. こんな時に…妙な対抗意識を
#. 燃やしてんじゃないわよ…
msgctxt "0076 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Stop trying to one-up e-everyone..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、私はもう１度、
#. あいつの部屋に行ってみるね。
msgctxt "0077 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Okay, then I'll go check his room one more time."
msgstr ""

#. 反応あるまで、しつこくインターホン押してみるよ。
msgctxt "0078 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I'm just gonna keep on hammering that button till I\n"
"get a response!"
msgstr ""

#. では、残った我らで手分けして捜すとしよう…
msgctxt "0079 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Very well, then the rest of us can go check the rest\n"
"of the building."
msgstr ""

#. 実際、手遅れになる前に…だろ？
msgctxt "0080 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Yeah. Before it's, y'know...too late."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>とにかく…急いで十神クンを捜さないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Anyway, we have to just do our best to find Byakuya.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンが行きそうな場所…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So where might Byakuya have gone...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかしたら、また…
#. <CLT><CLT 3>“学校の２階”<CLT><CLT 4>とか調べてる可能性も…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe he went to go check out the <CLT><CLT 3>2nd floor of the\n"
"school<CLT><CLT 4> again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. セレスさんは…
#. 十神クンを捜しに行かないの？
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Celeste...aren't you going to help look for Byakuya?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、まだ紅茶を飲んでおりませんわ。
msgctxt "0086 | CELES"
msgid "I have not had my tea yet."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 喉の渇きを潤さない事には
#. 何をする気にもなれません。
msgctxt "0088 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Until my thirst is satisfied, I have no urge to do\n"
"anything."
msgstr ""

#. 急かすのなら、山田君を急かしてくださいな。
msgctxt "0089 | CELES"
msgid ""
"If you are in a hurry, feel free to motivate Hifumi to\n"
"move faster."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>セレスさん、マイペースすぎないか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But aren't you being kind of...selfish?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 喉の渇きを潤さない事には
#. 何をする気にもなれません。
msgctxt "0092 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Until my thirst is satisfied, I have no urge to do\n"
"anything."
msgstr ""

#. 急かすのなら、山田君を急かしてくださいな。
msgctxt "0093 | CELES"
msgid ""
"If you are in a hurry, feel free to motivate Hifumi to\n"
"move faster."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0095 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな物、壊してやりたいけど…
#. 壊したら大変な事になるんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd love to just smash the stupid thing, but who knows\n"
"what would happen to me if I did...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなカメラで…
#. ボクらをずっと監視してるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They've been using these cameras to watch us this\n"
"whole time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ムカツクけど、今は無視するしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0098 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's infuriating...but I have to just try and not\n"
"think about it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今は、時計なんか気にしている場合じゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0099 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time to worry about the clock right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0100 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0101 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0102 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
